{
  "$comment": "The UI 1.0 vocabulary (design/plugin-v2 04): the one schema the host's validator, the SDK's types (scripts/gen-plugin-ui.mjs) and both shells' renderers are checked against. Prop types: string, number, boolean, text (a string the plugin already translated), node, nodes, json (any JSON), enum:a|b|c, token:<tone|size|gap|align|justify|width|icon|format|color>, action (an event: an action name or { action, args }). children: none | any | one | two | text. Adding a component or prop = a line here, a mapping in each renderer, and conformance scenes (tests/fixtures/plugin-ui).",
